<title>CANADA: Cominco says executive among Peru hostages.</title>
<headline>Cominco says executive among Peru hostages.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mining company Cominco Ltd said Wednesday that one of its employees was among the hostages being held by Peruvian guerrillas.</p>
<p>Cominco identified the employee as Kieran Metcalfe, manager of the Cajamarquilla refinery on the outskirts of Lima.</p>
<p>Peruvian guerrillas were holding up to 490 hostages in the Japanese ambassador's residence in Lima.</p>
<p>((-- Reuters Vancouver Bureau (604) 664-7314))</p>
